<h3 style="color:#174a63; margin:8px 0;">2. Track</h3>

<p style="color:#64748b; margin:0;">
View sample road damage reports in the table below.
</p>

</div>

<div style="flex:1 1 220px; background-color:white; padding:22px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; box-sizing:border-box;">

<div style="font-size:30px;">🛠️</div>

