<section id="report" style="background-color:white; padding:30px; border-radius:12px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; margin-bottom:35px; box-sizing:border-box;">

<h2 style="color:#102a43; margin:0 0 8px; font-size:27px;">
Report Road Damage
</h2>

<p style="color:#64748b; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:25px;">
Please provide accurate information about the damaged road.
</p>

<form>

<div style="margin-bottom:18px;">

<label for="name" style="display:block; font-weight:bold; margin-bottom:7px; color:#334155;">
Full Name <span style="color:#dc2626;">*</span>
</label>

<input type="text" id="name" name="name" placeholder="Enter your full name" required style="width:100%; padding:12px; box-sizing:border-box; border:1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius:6px; font-size:15px; background-color:#f8fafc;">

</div>

<div style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:18px;">

<div style="flex:1 1 220px; margin-bottom:18px;">

<label for="email" style="display:block; font-weight:bold; margin-bottom:7px; color:#334155;">
Email Address <span style="color:#dc2626;">*</span>
</label>

<input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="example@email.com" required style="width:100%; padding:12px; box-sizing:border-box; border:1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius:6px; font-size:15px; background-color:#f8fafc;">

</div>

<div style="flex:1 1 220px; margin-bottom:18px;">

<label for="phone" style="display:block; font-weight:bold; margin-bottom:7px; color:#334155;">
Phone Number (Optional)
</label>

<input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" placeholder="Enter phone number" style="width:100%; padding:12px; box-sizing:border-box; border:1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius:6px; font-size:15px; background-color:#f8fafc;">

</div>

</div>

<div style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:18px;">

<div style="flex:1 1 220px; margin-bottom:18px;">

<label for="location" style="display:block; font-weight:bold; margin-bottom:7px; color:#334155;">
Road / Street Name <span style="color:#dc2626;">*</span>
</label>

<input type="text" id="location" name="location" placeholder="Enter road or street name" required style="width:100%; padding:12px; box-sizing:border-box; border:1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius:6px; font-size:15px; background-color:#f8fafc;">

</div>

<div style="flex:1 1 220px; margin-bottom:18px;">

<label for="city" style="display:block; font-weight:bold; margin-bottom:7px; color:#334155;">
City <span style="color:#dc2626;">*</span>
</label>

<input type="text" id="city" name="city" placeholder="Enter city name" required style="width:100%; padding:12px; box-sizing:border-box; border:1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius:6px; font-size:15px; background-color:#f8fafc;">

</div>

</div>

<div style="margin-bottom:18px;">

<label for="damage" style="display:block; font-weight:bold; margin-bottom:7px; color:#334155;">
Type of Damage <span style="color:#dc2626;">*</span>
</label>

<select id="damage" name="damage" required style="width:100%; padding:12px; box-sizing:border-box; border:1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius:6px; font-size:15px; background-color:#f8fafc;">

<option value="">Select damage type</option>
<option value="Pothole">Pothole</option>
<option value="Cracked Road">Cracked Road</option>
<option value="Waterlogging">Waterlogging</option>
<option value="Broken Road">Broken Road</option>
<option value="Damaged Road Sign">Damaged Road Sign</option>
<option value="Other">Other</option>

</select>

</div>

<div style="margin-bottom:18px;">

<label for="description" style="display:block; font-weight:bold; margin-bottom:7px; color:#334155;">
Description of the Problem <span style="color:#dc2626;">*</span>
</label>

<textarea id="description" name="description" rows="5" placeholder="Describe the damage and mention a nearby landmark if possible..." required style="width:100%; padding:12px; box-sizing:border-box; border:1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius:6px; font-size:15px; background-color:#f8fafc; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; resize:vertical;"></textarea>

</div>

<div style="margin-bottom:25px;">

<label for="photo" style="display:block; font-weight:bold; margin-bottom:7px; color:#334155;">
Upload Road Photo (Optional)
</label>

<input type="file" id="photo" name="photo" accept="image/*" style="display:block; width:100%; padding:10px; box-sizing:border-box; border:1px dashed #94a3b8; border-radius:6px; background-color:#f8fafc;">

<p style="font-size:12px; color:#64748b; margin-bottom:0;">
Select an image of the damaged road from your device.
</p>

</div>

<p style="font-size:13px; color:#64748b;">
Fields marked with <span style="color:#dc2626;">*</span> are required.
</p>

<button type="submit" style="background-color:#087f73; color:white; border:none; padding:13px 25px; border-radius:6px; font-size:15px; font-weight:bold; cursor:pointer; margin-right:8px;">
Submit Report
</button>

<button type="reset" style="background-color:#e2e8f0; color:#334155; border:none; padding:13px 22px; border-radius:6px; font-size:15px; font-weight:bold; cursor:pointer;">
Clear Form
</button>

</form>

</section>


<section id="reports" style="background-color:white; padding:30px; border-radius:12px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; margin-bottom:35px; box-sizing:border-box;">

<h2 style="color:#102a43; margin:0 0 8px; font-size:27px;">
Reported Road Damage
</h2>

<p style="color:#64748b; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:20px;">
The following sample reports demonstrate how road damage reports can be displayed.
</p>

<div style="overflow-x:auto;">

<table border="1" style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; border-color:#e2e8f0; text-align:left; font-size:14px;">

<thead style="background-color:#174a63; color:white;">

<tr>
<th style="padding:13px 10px;">Report ID</th>
<th style="padding:13px 10px;">Location</th>
<th style="padding:13px 10px;">City</th>
<th style="padding:13px 10px;">Damage Type</th>
<th style="padding:13px 10px;">Description</th>
<th style="padding:13px 10px;">Status</th>
</tr>

</thead>

<tbody>

<tr style="background-color:#ffffff;">
<td style="padding:12px 10px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; font-weight:bold; color:#087f73;">RD001</td>
<td style="padding:12px 10px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0;">Mall Road</td>
<td style="padding:12px 10px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0;">Solan</td>
<td style="padding:12px 10px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0;">Pothole</td>
<td style="padding:12px 10px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; overflow-wrap:anywhere;">A large pothole near the bus stop.</td>
<td style="padding:12px 10px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; color:#92400e; font-weight:bold;">Reported</td>
</tr>

<tr style="background-color:#f8fafc;">
<td style="padding:12px 10px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; font-weight:bold; color:#087f73;">RD002</td>
<td style="padding:12px 10px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0;">Hospital Road</td>
<td style="padding:12px 10px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0;">Shimla</td>
<td style="padding:12px 10px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0;">Cracked Road</td>
<td style="padding:12px 10px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; overflow-wrap:anywhere;">Several cracks have appeared along the left side of the road.</td>
<td style="padding:12px 10px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; color:#92400e; font-weight:bold;">Reported</td>
</tr>

<tr style="background-color:#ffffff;">
<td style="padding:12px 10px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; font-weight:bold; color:#087f73;">RD003</td>
<td style="padding:12px 10px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0;">College Road</td>
<td style="padding:12px 10px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0;">Chandigarh</td>
<td style="padding:12px 10px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0;">Waterlogging</td>
<td style="padding:12px 10px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; overflow-wrap:anywhere;">Water collects on the road after heavy rainfall.</td>
<td style="padding:12px 10px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; color:#92400e; font-weight:bold;">Reported</td>
</tr>

<tr style="background-color:#f8fafc;">
<td style="padding:12px 10px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; font-weight:bold; color:#087f73;">RD004</td>
<td style="padding:12px 10px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0;">Station Road</td>
<td style="padding:12px 10px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0;">Kalka</td>
<td style="padding:12px 10px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0;">Broken Road</td>
<td style="padding:12px 10px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; overflow-wrap:anywhere;">A damaged section makes it difficult for vehicles to pass safely.</td>
<td style="padding:12px 10px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; color:#92400e; font-weight:bold;">Reported</td>
</tr>

</tbody>

</table>

</div>

</section>


<section id="about" style="background-color:#102a43; color:white; padding:30px; border-radius:12px; margin-bottom:25px;">

<h2 style="margin-top:0; font-size:26px;">
About RoadCare
</h2>

<p style="color:#dbeafe;">
RoadCare is a student project designed to demonstrate
how citizens could report road damage through a simple
online interface. It provides a form for entering road
details and displays sample reports on the webpage.
</p>

<p style="color:#dbeafe;">
Road damage can cause accidents, traffic congestion,
vehicle damage, and difficulties for pedestrians.
Identifying these problems is an important step
towards safer roads.
</p>

<p style="color:#dbeafe; margin-bottom:0;">
<strong>Our goal:</strong> Building safer roads, one report at a time.
</p>

